WEBVTT

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.620
It's not like that...

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.090
It's not like that at all.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.300
It's not the child that's bad.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.670
Goodbye, Sensei!

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.890
So hot!

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.900
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.600
I see you're energetic today even though it's so hot.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.590
I'm doing great!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.650
Goodbye, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.060
Goodbye!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:15.760
Hmm?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.800
Did something good happen today too?

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.420
It's a secret!

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.530
Go home without me.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:03.560
Okay.

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.210
When did I become like this?

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.140
I'm not really like this.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:18.140
Really...

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.600
We're home!

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:24.890
Home!

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.960
Welcome home, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.370
I came home too...

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.200
Want me to help you get changed?

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:40.390
I'm okay.  I can get changed all by myself.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:41.650
All right.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.220
Good girl, good girl.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.430
Parent's Day...

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.830
I have school that day... I can't go.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.340
Don't say that!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:08.070
I've been practicing my dance over and over.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.550
Even so...

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.020
I could almost cry...

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.170
Don't cry...

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.140
Let me see.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.730
Cut school and go.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:24.140
Seriously?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.600
You're always telling me to be more responsible,

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.980
and now you're telling me to ditch school?

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:35.100
You'll be fine as long as you graduate.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:38.020
You're her guardian, remember?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.540
That's weird...

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:42.830
All right, I got it.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.700
You're going to come?

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.190
Let me see.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:52.320
If Kippei goes all by himself, no one will take him seriously.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.090
I'll go along with him.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.030
Not taken seriously?  At preschool?

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:03.130
Why?  What's at preschool?

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.480
It'll be fine.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:05.960
But...

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.360
I'll go with him.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.350
Oh, okay.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.750
Well, that's how it's going to be.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:18.770
Yuzuyu, Nee-chan said she's going to be coming too.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.420
Yay!

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.200
Ta-da!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:31.240
Today's Special Item

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.000
Kagoshima Prefecture
Black Roast Pig

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:32.240
Today's Special Item

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.000
Errr...

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:40.430
Yes?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.610
I don't need these.

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:48.050
Okay, I'll cancel these.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.660
Hey, so what are you going to wear?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:10.430
If you wear something too flashy, then your child will ask you not to come next time.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.510
Yeah, but you want to look your best!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.710
It's your child's day to stand out.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:20.990
It's the children's day to stand out, so it's not about us.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.160
Oh, Nashiya-san!

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:24.650
You went shopping?

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.240
Nashiya-san, you're going to the Parent's Day, right?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:36.010
We were just discussing what we should wear to it.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:37.930
Parent's Day?

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.400
Oh no, you didn't know about it?

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.380
You have to come, Nashiya-san!

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.680
Hey, let's go shopping together sometime.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.190
I'll go!

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.820
What?!  For Parent's Day?

00:07:57.730 --> 00:07:58.900
Just to window shop.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:01.460
It's never good enough to just look!

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.340
This and this...

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.950
Welcome home, Mother.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.540
There's going to be a Parent's Day?!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:32.800
Yeah, this is the announcement.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.730
Why didn't you give it to me right away?!

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:46.350
All the other mothers were talking about it and I was the only one that wasn't aware of it!

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.400
How embarrassing!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:53.180
All those young people made fun of me!

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.610
I was thinking about giving it to you just now.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.300
Why are you talking back to me?!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.730
That's not it.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:06.430
Shut up!

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:21.540
I'm home.

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:32.540
What were you doing?

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.760
Hey!  Dear!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:40.920
What?

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.620
Did you find a job?!

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.430
Shouta...

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:52.060
Let's go outside.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:21.290
A butterfly!

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:26.500
Be careful.  Watch where you're walking.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.510
Shou-chan!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.910
What?  Is that your friend?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.180
Yeah, Shou-chan!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:44.860
What?

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:46.720
Hey, it's Yuzuyu-chan!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.720
The bad girl.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.850
I'm on my way back from shopping.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.610
You go shopping by yourself?

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.130
I'm with Kippei-onii-chan.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.450
Oh, him.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:01.940
Him?

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:04.810
Ah!  A butterfly.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.910
If you talk loudly, then it'll fly away.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.760
What's this?  Those two have that kind of relationship?

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:23.750
Shou-chan.

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:25.460
Here.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:27.200
Oh, this.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.800
I fell off the monkey bars over there earlier.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.460
Does it hurt?

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.930
Not at all.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.010
Shouta!  Let's go!

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.120
Okay!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:46.620
See ya!

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.010
Bye-bye.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:52.890
Monkey bars.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.800
There are no monkey bars here.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:19.260
Ta-da!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.740
I'm here.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:25.820
I think you're going overboard.

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:30.920
What's going on today?

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.190
It's Yuzuyu-chan's Parent's Day.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:36.550
Oh, I see.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:39.660
What is it?

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:44.230
I'm worried that we'll be mistaken for a young married couple if we go together.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.330
I don't think so.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.280
I'm wearing a high school uniform, plus we really look like siblings.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.350
Why are you wearing your uniform?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.110
I'm going to go to school afterwards.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:55.900
Aren't I good?

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.550
I wonder whose mother she is.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:04.820
I have no idea.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.800
It seems so small!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.440
It's a preschool, of course it is!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.250
What a pretty mama.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.290
Yuzuyu!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.240
What kind of relationship does this lady have with Kippei-san?!

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:20.590
Kippei!

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.200
Where is Yuzuyu-chan's drawing?

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.490
Nee-chan!  Don't go walking off on your own!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.080
What is it?

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:29.350
Follow me.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.090
Hey!  Don't pull me!

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.880
It's fine, come on.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:37.390
Hey, Yuzuyu!

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:39.200
Shou-chan!

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:45.610
You know what?

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:49.120
I'm going to be dancing today!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.170
Really?

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:00.260
What?

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.560
It's nothing.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:53.790
Yuzuyu's amazing!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:55.750
She can dance!

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:58.020
Yuzuyu can dance!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.170
Of course she can dance.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:02.760
She was dancing at the Sports Day too.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.600
That was then, this is now!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.500
Look, look!  Look at that intent look on her face.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:19.730
I'm watching.

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:42.780
Today we are going to use a big piece of origami paper and try folding a morning glory flower.

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.790
Does everyone have a piece of origami paper?

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:47.630
Yes!

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:51.500
Shouta, what are you making?

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:54.800
Sensei!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.450
Yes?  What is it?

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.720
I want to defeat all the bad guys!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:05.260
Oh my, isn't that wonderful...

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.810
Now let's trying folding a morning glory.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.700
Hey...

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.380
Don't laugh.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.550
I'm going to make a sword too!

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:18.540
I made one!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.440
All right, it's a duel!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:24.970
Everyone, we must make a morning glory!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.450
Shouta, your sword is really cool!

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.670
Okay, the balls go over there.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:58.450
Sensei.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:03.580
What is our Yuzuyu like at preschool?

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.890
She's very bright.

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:11.110
You're Yuzuyu-chan's mother?

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:14.380
But... huh?

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:16.670
I'm sorry, Sensei.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.370
This is my older sister.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.220
Does it look like I have children?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.760
Oh, no... Well...

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:28.080
Nee-chan!

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:28.900
Ouch!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.910
You're making me mad!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:37.770
What?  I thought since we are here I should ask about all sorts of things.

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:40.570
What are you going to accomplish by scaring Sensei?

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.220
How rude!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:45.870
It's not rude!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:54.050
Hmm?  Yuzuyu's not here...

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:08.720
Mother!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.470
Are you going home already?

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.860
Why are you mad?

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:20.020
You sure are stupid!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:21.570
Ouch!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.760
Why can't you do what everyone else is doing?!

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:29.410
You made me very sad again!

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:46.680
Don't hit Shou-chan!

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.350
Yuzuyu...

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.130
Yuzuyu!  What are you doing?

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:55.980
She hit him!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:57.970
What?

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.140
She did!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.180
What?

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:02.850
What happened?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:08.700
She hit Shou-chan!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.930
I wasn't hit!

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.090
So she's the one.

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.640
The one with no parents.

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:39.190
Pointing a finger at an adult and screaming...

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:40.730
What a bad child.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.130
Kippei, stop it.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:47.310
What is it?

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.590
Everyone, please go back to the classroom.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:51.730
Ma'am,

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:56.860
what are you saying to a child?

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:02.210
I fell off the monkey bars over there earlier.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.480
Maybe Yuzuyu was telling the truth.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:12.290
Aren't you in high school?

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:13.920
Yeah, so?

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.110
Just because you've looked after a kid for a little while,

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.530
do you think you're suddenly a parent?

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:21.530
Give me a break!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:26.070
What do you do for a child?  What can you do?

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:30.630
A real parent goes through much more.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.090
It's not like your little tea party!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:44.940
I'm sorry he stuck his nose in your business.

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:51.930
Honestly, I don't care about your situations at home.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:58.490
So, don't act like you know what you're talking about based only on rumors about our family.

00:21:00.890 --> 00:21:02.830
Shouta-kun, come here.

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:08.600
I've noticed bruises on Shouta-kun's body lately.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.740
He won't say anything,

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.210
but if this continues, we can't give him back to you.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.130
Look, Shouta.

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:26.230
Everyone is blaming me because you won't do things properly.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:32.840
I get so tired of being around you!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:37.880
Mother...

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.090
Wait!  Don't leave me!

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:46.500
Let me go!

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:47.340
Shou-chan!

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:49.230
Mother!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:01.960
Yuzuyu-chan.

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:22.260
Shou-chan's in trouble!  Shou-chan is...

00:24:22.400 --> 00:24:25.480
Don't worry, Yuzuyu!  I'll do something.

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:26.350
Really?

00:24:26.420 --> 00:24:28.270
Yeah, leave it me!

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:36.040
All right.  First we'll go meet Shouta's mom, and then, and then... Umm...

00:24:36.040 --> 00:24:37.540
Are you really all right?

00:24:38.120 --> 00:24:39.960
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:40.270 --> 00:24:41.910
Shou-chan, Let's Meet Again...

00:24:42.520 --> 00:24:44.320
No!  I don't want to!

00:24:44.320 --> 00:24:47.050
Don't cry!  I'll do something about it!
